<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30051" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔγερσις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>awaking</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Coac.</u>
				82
			</span></i>; personified in <i><span class="en">
				Emp.
				123.1
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.206S.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Polyaen.
				2.2.6
			</span></i>: metaph., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ τοῦ θυμοῦ
			ἔ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				70c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>EN</u>
				1116b30
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>awaking</i> from death, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Matt.</u>
				27.53
			</span></i>; <i>recovery</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τοῦ πάθεος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SA</u>
					2.11
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>raising, erection</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τειχίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					8.5.4
				</span></i>
			 (pl.), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Men.Eph.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>AJ</u>
				8.5.3
			</span></i>.</div>
